          ],
          "text": "According to Petitioner (Raymond G. Kuntz), according to Petitioner (Raymond G. Kuntz), the statute awarding attorney fees as part of costs should not be expanded to include expert\u2011witness fees."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Petitioner (Raymond G. Kuntz)",
          "citations": [
