              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 3,
                "start": 3
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Petitioner (Raymond G. Kuntz), according to Petitioner (Raymond G. Kuntz), expert fees are not attorney fees nor costs; the statute contains no reference to expert fees."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. KUNTZ",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "2f9f97030f370fb133828d0b2d93a4a684f008801756df5434729a6a74ab33c6",
              "evidence_ids": [
