              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 53,
                "start": 52
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. KUNTZ, shifting the costs of expert fees to the school district would divert scarce public resources away from the stage where parents meet with the IEP team to resolve differences."
        },
